    <node id="&quot;NOV 14, 2019&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nov 14, 2019 is the date when the CUNA's National Awards Committee announced the 2019 recipients of the Dora Maxwell Social Responsibility Award."</data>
